1
00:00:00,488 --> 00:00:01,868
(Leonard:)It'll be fun.

2
00:00:02,031 --> 00:00:04,241
Like a clown car. Heh, heh.

3
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:06,870
(Penny:)-Hang on.
-Hm, yeah? What? Huh?

4
00:00:07,411 --> 00:00:08,581
(Penny:)We just broke up.

5
00:00:08,788 --> 00:00:09,998
(Leonard:)You and me? Yeah, we did.

6
00:00:10,164 --> 00:00:12,414
(Leonard:)Not too long ago.
How are you doing with it?

7
00:00:12,917 --> 00:00:14,587
(Penny:)Not as good as you, apparently.

8
00:00:14,794 --> 00:00:16,084
(Leonard:)I don't follow.

9
00:00:16,295 --> 00:00:17,965
You know, it's none of my business.

10
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:22,090
You wanna sleep with Sheldon's buddy
right after we broke up, go for it.

11
00:00:22,301 --> 00:00:25,051
(Leonard:)-Well, now--
SHELDON: Excuse me.

12
00:00:25,221 --> 00:00:27,221
(Sheldon:)I'm uncomfortable
with you recommending...

13
00:00:27,390 --> 00:00:29,680
...Leonard pursue intercourse
with Dr. Plimpton.

14
00:00:29,851 --> 00:00:32,731
(Sheldon:)Who, I assure you,
has better things to do.

15
00:00:32,937 --> 00:00:34,107
(Penny:)I'm not recommending it.

16
00:00:34,272 --> 00:00:35,772
(Penny:)I'm saying it already happened.

17
00:00:35,982 --> 00:00:37,192
Oh, that's preposterous.

18
00:00:37,358 --> 00:00:39,398
(Sheldon:)Tell her, Leonard.

19
00:00:39,986 --> 00:00:41,736
(Sheldon:)Well....

20
00:00:44,782 --> 00:00:46,032
(Raj:)No.

21
00:00:46,242 --> 00:00:48,122
Oh, come on. It wasn't my fault.

22
00:00:48,327 --> 00:00:54,087
(Sheldon:)The implication being that you somehow
tripped and fell into her lady parts?

23
00:00:55,585 --> 00:00:57,625
(Penny:)I'm just gonna take the bus to work.

24
00:00:57,837 --> 00:01:00,717
(Leonard:)-Penny, I can still drive you.
-No, no, it's okay.

